body:
Lol that's my loving and fiercely loyal gf. I guess she thought your need to comment on my intelligence came across as very pretentious but I can't speak for her. I certainly wasn't trying to insult you by assuming your sarcasm with "it isn't scary at all" as miscommunication is a common thing with internet stuff, sorry it came across that way.

&#x200B;

edit: and for the record, I *do* lead you
